## Where things live (Strapi orientation)

- `src/api/**` — content-types, controllers, routes, services (one folder per content-type)
- `src/admin/**` — admin panel customizations
- `config/**` — server, database, admin, middleware, plugin config (reads from env vars via `env()`)
- `database/migrations/**` — DB migrations

When adding a new content-type, controller, or route, follow the existing structure under `src/api/` rather than inventing a new layout.
